sequenceDiagram
    actor Issuer as Approved course issuer
    actor Learner as Learner
    participant App as CredentialLoop app
    participant Registry as CredentialLoopRegistry
    actor Verifier as Employer / verifier

    Issuer->>App: Create credential and sign its off-chain content
    App->>Registry: issueCredential(random salted reference)
    Registry-->>App: CredentialIssued event; current status is Active
    App-->>Learner: Deliver signed credential and reference
    Learner->>Verifier: Share credential and reference by consent
    Verifier->>App: Request a status check
    App->>Registry: checkCredential(reference)
    Registry-->>App: active status and issuer address
    App-->>Verifier: Display result; credential content stays off-chain

    opt Issuer later withdraws the credential
        Issuer->>App: Request revocation
        App->>Registry: revokeCredential(reference)
        Registry-->>App: CredentialRevoked event; status is Revoked
    end
